      "question": "Muscle attachments",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-72d8906d25",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-72d8906d25",
          "answer": "Coccygeus and levator ani attach to sides/anterior aspect; gluteus maximus attaches posteriorly; anococcygeal body connects it to anal region.",
